  "notes": "FORMAL VOCABULARY:\n{破棄|はき} is a formal term used in legal, business, and technical contexts.\n\nSENSE 1 (DESTRUCTION):\nUsed for proper disposal of documents, data, evidence, etc.\n- ⟦{書類|しょるい}→書類：01103_shorui⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{破棄|はき} - document destruction\n- ⟦データ→データ：03944_deeta⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{破棄|はき} - data deletion\n\nSENSE 2 (ANNULMENT):\nUsed in legal and diplomatic contexts.\n- ⟦{契約|けいやく}→契約：02698_keiyaku⟧{破棄|はき} - contract annulment\n- ⟦{判決|はんけつ}→判決：05906_hanketsu⟧{破棄|はき} - reversal of verdict (appellate court)\n- ⟦{条約|じょうやく}→条約：04912_jouyaku⟧{破棄|はき} - treaty abrogation\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{廃棄|はいき}→廃棄：12482_haiki⟧ - disposal, scrapping (similar to sense 1)\n- {取|と}り{消|け}し - cancellation (more general)\n- ⟦{解約|かいやく}→解約：06129_kaiyaku⟧ - termination (of contract)\n- ⟦{無効|むこう}→無効：13385_mukou⟧ - invalid, null",
